  "question": {
    "text": "If [ <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>t</mi></math> denotes the greatest integer <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8804;</mo><mn>1</mn></math>, then the value of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mrow><mn>3</mn><mfenced><mrow><mi>e</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mi>e</mi></mfrac><msubsup><mo>&#8747;</mo><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></msubsup><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><msup><mi>e</mi><mrow><mfenced open=\"[\" close=\"]\"><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mfenced open=\"[\" close=\"]\"><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>3</mn></msup></mfenced></mrow></msup><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi></math> is :"
  },
  "options": [
    {
      "text": "<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>e</mi><mn>9</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mi>e</mi></math>",
